## Phase 2 — Data model

**Goal:** Every type the rest of the app will use, agreed once.

```text
Define the complete data model in src/types.ts. Do not build UI or logic yet.

Types needed:

Player:
- id (string, uuid), name (string), isActive (boolean)
- joinedAtRound (number) — index of the round they became available
- gamesPlayed (number) — true count, used for stats
- queueCredit (number) — a virtual head start used ONLY by the rotation queue, never shown to the user (see SessionEngine spec in a later phase)
- wins, losses (number)
- pointsFor, pointsAgainst (number) — rally points scored/conceded across all games
- restStreak (number) — consecutive rounds sat out
- partnerHistory: Record<playerId, number> — times partnered with each other player
- opponentHistory: Record<playerId, number> — times faced each other player

