Match: id, courtNumber, teamA (Team), teamB (Team), status ('pending' | 'completed' | 'voided'), scoreA, scoreB (number | null), roundIndex.
Round: index, matches (Match[]), sittingOut (playerId[]), status ('in-progress' | 'completed').

SessionConfig: courtCount, startTime (ISO string), endTime (ISO string), minutesPerGame, pointsPerWin, pointsPerLoss, targetScore (e.g. 21), lateJoinerMode ('fair-forward' | 'catch-up').

SessionState: config, players (Player[]), rounds (Round[]), currentRoundIndex, status ('setup' | 'active' | 'ended').

LeaderboardEntry: rank, player, sessionPoints, pointDifferential, winRate.

Add a defaults constant: courtCount 2, minutesPerGame 12, pointsPerWin 3, pointsPerLoss 1, targetScore 21, lateJoinerMode 'fair-forward'.

