## Phase 8 — Mid-session roster edits

**Goal:** The late-friend problem, handled gracefully.

```text
Build the roster editing sheet, reachable from the "Edit players" button at any time during an active session.

Contents:
- A list of all players with games played, wins, and current points. Active players first, players who left shown dimmed at the bottom under "Left early".
